        },
        {
          "text": "Imana yibuka Nowa n’ibifise ubugingo vyose, n’ibitungano vyose vyari kumwe na we mu bgato: Imana ihūhīsha umuyaga kw isi, amazi atangura kugabanuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 8:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasōko y’i kuzimu arazibirwa, n’ingomero zo mw ijuru ziragomerwa, imvura iva mw ijuru irabogozwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.7.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 7:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amazi agenda ahōka kw isi ubudasiba: ya misi ijana na mirongwitanu ishize, amazi atangura kugeruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kw’ indwi, ku musi wakwo w’icumi n’ indwi, bga bgato buhagarara ku misozi yo muri Ararati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazi agenda arageruka ubudasiba, gushitsa mu kwezi kw’icumi: mu kwezi kw’icumi, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, udutwe tw’ imisozi turaboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imisi mirongwine ishize, Nowa yugurura idirisha ry’ubgato yabāje; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arekura igikōna, kiragenda kirajarajara gushitsa aho amazi yakamiye kw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ arekura inuma kugira ngw amenye kw amazi yoba agabanutse kw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ntiyabona aho ishinga ikirenge, imugarukako mu bgato, kukw amazi yar’agikwiye kw isi yose: atuma ukuboko arayifata, ayizana mu bgato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asiba iyindi misi ndwi, yongera kurekura iyo numa ngw ive mu bgato; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igaruka kuri we ku mugoroba, ifise akababi kabisi k’umwelayo mu kanwa. Nuko Nowa aca amenya kw amazi agabanutse kw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asība iyindi misi ndwi, arekura iyo numa, ntiyasubira kumugarukak’ ukundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mu mwaka w’amajana atandatu na rimwe, mu kwezi kwa mbere, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, amazi akama kw isi. Nowa akūrah’ igisakaye ubgo bgato, aritegereza, abona isi yūmūtse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kwa kabiri, ku musi wakwo wa mirongwibiri n’ indwi, isi irūma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
