              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Nowa yubakira Uhoraho igicaniro, yābīra mu bitungano vyose no mu bikōko vyose bitazira, no mu biguruka vyose bitazira, abitangira kur’ ico gicaniro kw ibimazi vyo kwoswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
