        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho amoterwa n’umubabge mwiza wavyo, maz’ Uhoraho yiyumvira mu mutima wiwe, ati Sinzokwongera kuvuma isi ukundi kubg’ abantu, kukw imitima y’abantu yamogoreye gukora ibibi uhereye mu bgana bgabo: kandi sinzokwongera kwica ukundi ibifise ubugingo vyose, nk’uko nakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
